      <title>Ali Fazal named International Goodwill Ambassador to champion refugee rights and fight human trafficking</title>
      <link>https://www.indulgexpress.com/entertainment/celebs/2025/Dec/01/ali-fazal-named-international-goodwill-ambassador-to-champion-refugee-rights-and-fight-human-trafficking</link>
      <description>Actor Ali Fazal has been appointed as the international goodwill ambassador for Goodwill Caravan, a non-profit dedicated to protecting refugees and displaced people from human trafficking and exploitation across Northern Africa, the Middle East, and Europe. His role will involve amplifying awareness, mobilising support, and working directly with vulnerable communities, reflecting his deep personal commitment to humanitarian causes and empathy for those affected by war and displacement.</description>
