    <item>
      <title>Indo Warehouse unites Anyasa, Lost Stories and Punjabi folk in landmark track Patasa ahead of India Tour</title>
      <link>https://www.indulgexpress.com/culture/music/2025/Dec/01/indo-warehouse-unites-anyasa-lost-stories-and-punjabi-folk-in-landmark-track-patasa-ahead-of-india-tour</link>
      <description>Indo Warehouse closes the year with a landmark release, Patasa, uniting Anyasa, Lost Stories, and Punjabi folk vocalist Sarthak Kalyani in their first original collaboration. The track blends deep Indian roots with global club energy, balancing tribal percussion and Indo-inspired stabs with evocative Punjabi vocals. Patasa stands as a cultural milestone ahead of Indo Warehouse’s highly anticipated India tour this December, symbolizing the fusion of tradition, modernity, and diaspora identity.</description>
